    {
      "id": "c954d5fd448c3084342d57b64901338e1a00d3b2",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2334740901,
          "type": null,
          "body": "This is significantly increasing the number of false positives for HiPerConTracer, to the point where I would consider disabling the heuristic by default. The previous settings required the timestamp value to be plausible when interpreted as microseconds, and hence between (1238799600000000 and 3889637999999999), representing 0.01437% of the 64 bit space searched for the timestamp.\n\nThe new settings, in addition to that fraction, also allow the timestamp to be plausible when interpreted as nanoseconds, and thus between 1238799600000000000 and 3889637999999999000, representing 14.37% of the 64 bit space.\n\nThat is a *massive* decrease in the power of the heuristic. A heuristic that accepts over 14% of all packets as belonging to the protocol should not be enabled by default. There is another (weak) check to specifically exempt SASL LDAP messages, but it looks for fairly specific values and doesn't significantly change the result.\n\nThere are also weak checks for the TTL (a one-byte value cannot be 0) and the length (the total length of the payload cannot be less than 16), but those also do not meaningfully change the result.\n\nAmong the payloads that now pass the heuristic check are all SSDP M-SEARCH packets:\n```\n0000  4d 2d 53 45 41 52 43 48  20 2a 20 48 54 54 50 2f   M-SEARCH  * HTTP/\n0010  31 2e 31 0d 0a                                     1.1··\n```\n\n```\nHiPerConTracer Trace Service\n    Magic Number: 0x4d2d5345\n    Send TTL: 65\n    Round: 82\n    Sequence Number: 17224\n    Send Time Stamp: Mar 10, 2050 05:40:53.260087343 UTC\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-02-06T15:47:38.244Z",
          "updated_at": "2025-02-06T16:13:55.775Z",
